     "source": "Nature Biotech",
     "content": "Subjects\nCorrection to: Nature Biotechnology https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-025-02624-w, published online 31 March 2025.\nIn the version of this article initially published, there was an error in Fig. 3b and associated Source Data, where AT8 data was mistakenly duplicated into the Aβ plaque data; an error in Extended Data Fig. 1i and associated Source Data, where day 4 behavioral readings of WT and 5xFAD swimming speeds were duplicated into day 5 data; and an error in Extended Data Fig. 8f, where six data points were duplicated in the 5×FAD; AAV-PHP.eB-EGFP group. In the Fig. 2b Source Data, one table was labeled “PS19” instead of “5×FAD,” while in the Extended Data Fig. 5 Source Data, panels a–h and i–n were arranged in incorrect order. The figures and Source Data are now updated in the HTML and PDF versions of the article. For comparison, the original figures are available as Supplementary Information accompanying this amendment.\nAuthor information\nAuthors and Affiliations\nCorresponding author\nSupplementary information\nRights and permissions\nAbout this article\nCite this article\nFeng, X., Jiang, BW., Zhai, SN. et al. Author Correction: Circular RNA aptamers targeting neuroinflammation ameliorate Alzheimer disease phenotypes in mouse models. Nat Biotechnol (2026). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-026-03281-3\n- Published: \n- Version of record: \n- DOI: https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-026-03281-3",
