     "title": "APOD: 2026 August 14 – Total Solar Eclipse from Greenland",
     "url": "https://science.nasa.gov/image-article/apod/apod-2026-august-14-total-solar-eclipse-from-greenland/",
     "time": "08-14 12:05",
