     "title": "SpaceX launches Tuesday noontime Starlink mission following Monday scrub",
     "url": "https://spaceflightnow.com/2026/08/10/live-coverage-spacex-to-launch-29-starlink-satellites-on-falcon-9-rocket-from-cape-canaveral-16/",
