     "title": "Your guide to GitHub Universe 2026 is here: The schedule just launched!",
     "url": "https://github.blog/news-insights/company-news/your-guide-to-github-universe-2026-is-here-the-schedule-just-launched/",
     "time": "08-14 03:00",
