     "title": "Trump slaps a 100 percent tariff on heavy and 'sensitive' drones",
     "url": "https://www.engadget.com/2236830/trump-slaps-100-percent-tariff-on-heavy-and-sensitive-drones/",
     "time": "08-14 14:12",
