     "title": "How bad is the UK drought and how long will it continue?",
     "url": "https://www.newscientist.com/article/2584619-how-bad-is-the-uk-drought-and-how-long-will-it-continue/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&utm_content=home&utm_medium=RSS&utm_source=NSNS",
