     "title": "Monsoon-driven wildfires may have shaped human evolution",
     "url": "https://www.newscientist.com/article/2584578-monsoon-driven-wildfires-may-have-shaped-human-evolution/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&utm_content=home&utm_medium=RSS&utm_source=NSNS",
